{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"k8s-title","type":"text","text":"# Kubernetes 学习模块\n\n**说明**：方案 A 快速回顾 + 架构、命令、故障、面试深化。\n\n— 9 份复习笔记 —","x":-160,"y":-260,"width":320,"height":80,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"k8s-00","type":"file","file":"00-Kubernetes学习路线.md","x":-150,"y":-130,"width":300,"height":50},
		{"id":"k8s-00-list","type":"text","text":"00-Kubernetes学习路线.md\n─────\n• §0 心智模型\n• §1 课堂资料覆盖范围\n• §2 方案 A 复习顺序\n• §3 7 问学习法\n• §4 实验环境策略\n• §5 验收标准\n• §6 后续路线","x":200,"y":-130,"width":360,"height":200},
		{"id":"k8s-01","type":"file","file":"01-容器运行时与集群安装.md","x":-650,"y":130,"width":280,"height":50},
		{"id":"k8s-01-list","type":"text","text":"01-容器运行时与集群安装.md\n─────\n• Containerd / ctr / nerdctl / crictl\n• CRI / CNI / CSI 边界\n• Linux 前置：swap / 模块 / sysctl\n• kubeadm 初始化与节点加入\n• Calico 网络与验证\n• 常见安装故障","x":-950,"y":130,"width":360,"height":200},
		{"id":"k8s-02","type":"file","file":"02-Kubernetes核心架构与对象模型.md","x":-150,"y":130,"width":300,"height":50},
		{"id":"k8s-02-list","type":"text","text":"02-Kubernetes核心架构与对象模型.md\n─────\n• 控制平面 vs Worker\n• 一次 apply 的 18 步\n• spec / status / object\n• Namespace / Context / kubeconfig\n• Label / Selector / OwnerReference\n• 控制器 / 静态 Pod","x":200,"y":130,"width":380,"height":200},
		{"id":"k8s-03","type":"file","file":"03-Pod与工作负载.md","x":-650,"y":360,"width":280,"height":50},
		{"id":"k8s-03-list","type":"text","text":"03-Pod与工作负载.md\n─────\n• Pod 生命周期\n• 多容器 Pod\n• ReplicaSet / Deployment\n• DaemonSet / Job / CronJob\n• 探针：Startup / Readiness / Liveness\n• 滚动更新与回滚","x":-950,"y":360,"width":360,"height":200},
		{"id":"k8s-04","type":"file","file":"04-配置与安全.md","x":-150,"y":360,"width":300,"height":50},
		{"id":"k8s-04-list","type":"text","text":"04-配置与安全.md\n─────\n• ConfigMap / Secret\n• API 访问控制链路\n• X.509 / kubeconfig\n• Role / ClusterRole / Binding\n• ServiceAccount\n• SecurityContext","x":200,"y":360,"width":360,"height":200},
		{"id":"k8s-05","type":"file","file":"05-Kubernetes网络与Service.md","x":-650,"y":590,"width":280,"height":50},
		{"id":"k8s-05-list","type":"text","text":"05-Kubernetes网络与Service.md\n─────\n• Pod 网络与 CNI\n• Service 类型与发现\n• EndpointSlice\n• kube-proxy iptables / IPVS\n• 会话保持\n• Ingress / 金丝雀","x":-950,"y":590,"width":360,"height":200},
		{"id":"k8s-06","type":"file","file":"06-Kubernetes存储与StatefulSet.md","x":-150,"y":590,"width":300,"height":50},
		{"id":"k8s-06-list","type":"text","text":"06-Kubernetes存储与StatefulSet.md\n─────\n• emptyDir / hostPath / NFS\n• PV / PVC 绑定\n• AccessMode / VolumeMode\n• StorageClass / 动态卷\n• StatefulSet 稳定身份和存储\n• Nginx / Etcd / Redis / MySQL 案例","x":200,"y":590,"width":380,"height":220},
		{"id":"k8s-07","type":"file","file":"07-调度资源弹性与健康检查.md","x":-650,"y":850,"width":280,"height":50},
